{"id":79,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"When this Pokémon’s tail is soaked in water, sweetness seeps from it. Slowpoke uses this trait to lure in and fish up other Pokémon."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Slow-witted and oblivious, this Pokémon won’t feel any pain if its tail gets eaten. It won’t notice when its tail grows back, either."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Incredibly slow and sluggish. It is quite content to loll about without worrying about the time."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Although their tails, which fall off naturally, can easily be found lying around, they’re a precious ingredient for cooking."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"There are some places where Slowpoke is worshiped because of a long-standing belief that whenever Slowpoke yawns, it rains."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Alolan home cooking involves drying Slowpoke tails and then simmering them into a salty stew."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Its long tail often breaks off. It doesn’t really feel any pain, though, and the tail grows back, so Slowpoke isn’t particularly bothered."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Slowpoke uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this Pokémon often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won’t even notice for a whole day."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten."},{"games":["SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"A sweet sap leaks from its tail’s tip. Although not nutritious, the tail is pleasant to chew on."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"Incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It catches prey by dipping its tail in water at the side of a river. But it often forgets what it is doing and spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Oblivious","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Own Tempo","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Pink","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":79,"name":"Slowpoke","condition":null,"children":[{"id":80,"name":"Slowbro","condition":"Lv. 37 or Use Galarica Cuff","children":[]},{"id":199,"name":"Slowking","condition":"Trade, holding King’s Rock or Use Galarica Wreath","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,174],[3,45],[6,55],[9,281],[12,93],[15,50],[18,352],[21,29],[24,428],[27,133],[30,57],[33,303],[36,94],[39,244],[42,240],[45,505]],"machine":[133,419,59,34,523,347,886,174,91,89,203,797,263,126,53,492,447,270,56,58,196,286,113,710,341,182,60,244,94,678,473,240,156,247,285,214,883,500,164,241,57,129,36,851,86,271,433,352,127,311,250,428],"egg":[562,187,335,23],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv1-204","name":"Slowpoke","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"204","artist":"Toshinao Aoki","img":"sv1/204"},{"id":"me55-16","name":"Slowpoke","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"16","artist":"Uninori","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-16/small","la